problems:
it reports an error: Invalid Query: The type "{ x: number; }" has no corresponding PostgreSQL type.
Please add it manually using the "overrides.types" option:
```ts
{
  "connections": {
    ...,
    "overrides": {
      "types": {
        "PG TYPE (e.g. 'date')": "{ x: number; }"
      }
    }
  }
}
```
Read docs - https://safeql.dev/api/#connections-overrides-types-optional
